# NFR checklist (ISO/IEC 25010) — every answer must be a NUMBER, not an adjective
- Performance: p95/p99 latency at a stated load (e.g. p95 < 300 ms at 200 RPS)?
- Throughput: sustained and peak requests/records per second?
- Availability: target (e.g. 99.9%) and maintenance-window policy?
- Capacity/scalability: data growth per year; horizontal scaling expectations?
- Recovery: RPO and RTO; backup frequency?
- Security level: OWASP ASVS L2 assumed — any deviation?
- Privacy: data classes handled; DPDP applies? (see dpdp.md)
- Accessibility: WCAG 2.2 AA assumed — any exception?
- Localisation: languages, locales, time zones, currency formats?
- Observability: required metrics, logs, traces, alerts, dashboards?
- Compatibility: supported browsers/devices; API versioning policy?
- Maintainability: coverage and mutation thresholds (defaults in eco.gates.yaml) — any change?
